{"agent_id":"ldsw","agent_seq":31,"timestamp":"2026-10-08T03:24:18.769551Z","event":{"type":"CommentAdded","issue_uuid":"7737f1ae-534a-44cd-829b-c7880380a33f","comment_uuid":"af21d571-93c4-447e-97a1-c7e63c01e245","author":"ldsw","content":"PE review (1 cold agent, primer + platform-engineer + 6 supplements, 60/60 advisory tool uses, ~5 min, model inherited). Findings: PE-01 blocker - :latest also hard-coded in container.rs IMAGE_TAG; 'container start' has no --image/env override; swarm lifecycle.rs:709 and sentinel engine.rs:455 use DEFAULT_AGENT_IMAGE; check_staleness() never fires (label only on local :local builds, and hashes a host Mach-O against a Linux binary). PE-02 blocker - three workflows fire independently on v* tags: :latest moves before smoke-verify and before crates.io, no rollback; no rulesets or main protection (verified); workflow_dispatch from any branch overwrites :nightly. PE-03 should-fix - option 3 (version-matched image) is right but needs an explicit build-time channel because build.rs appends +hash to every git build; :nightly needs --pull=always; bump version before the first Corvidae tag; never backfill :latest from v0.9.0-beta.1. PE-04 - shipped 0.9.0-beta.1 binaries default to ghcr.io/forecast-bio/crosslink-agent:latest, so old-owner images must stay public and frozen. PE-05 - anonymous token check proves visibility, not that a tag exists: HEAD each pushed tag, plus a scheduled canary on the shipped default ref. PE-06 - image not reproducible or attested (curl|bash installers, unpinned codex, gosu without checksum, base by tag, provenance false). PE-07 - prefer trusted publishing; add --locked to the real publish; cargo install resolves 0.8.0. PE-08 - no linux aarch64 or macOS arm64 binaries; checksums/attestations. PE-09 - docs call mutable tags immutable; nightly retention. PE-10 - docs.yml permissions at workflow level. Spot-verified by orchestrator: PE-01 call sites and staleness label, build.rs suffix, no rulesets/protection.","created_at":"2026-10-08T03:24:18.733848Z","kind":"observation","signed_by":"SHA256:2DlhR+oFnVKNEPsahz+cG6GYEUUTKJkJUtdRSniweHI","signature":"U1NIU0lHAAAAAQAAADMAAAALc3NoLWVkMjU1MTkAAAAgDPj6fD8/zRZvUXWw//OEuKiIM7V2BnG7lBF86x/hrWIAAAARY3Jvc3NsaW5rLWNvbW1lbnQAAAAAAAAABnNoYTUxMgAAAFMAAAALc3NoLWVkMjU1MTkAAABAE/sWm6QICcu/v2/CBYrafMjR1k/xHSpUmif7yssMzYeDUa6D6IYtHDtx8noS2yZeynjP1gg6bnbDbN5ySX+3Cw=="},"signed_by":"SHA256:2DlhR+oFnVKNEPsahz+cG6GYEUUTKJkJUtdRSniweHI","signature":"U1NIU0lHAAAAAQAAADMAAAALc3NoLWVkMjU1MTkAAAAgDPj6fD8/zRZvUXWw//OEuKiIM7V2BnG7lBF86x/hrWIAAAAPY3Jvc3NsaW5rLWV2ZW50AAAAAAAAAAZzaGE1MTIAAABTAAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5AAAAQPTVEoWjYmhzl3tYJCi5eSPHe4lRv7Ib8qeMIzWxqvVzv6NhPkYpMy9Ncl2Q89otwHSzXZctK88y9TWhAJWSrAo="}
