{"agent_id":"ldsw","agent_seq":100,"timestamp":"2026-10-09T02:24:27.882284Z","event":{"type":"CommentAdded","issue_uuid":"eb1a4388-3986-477b-b657-86a21e83c800","comment_uuid":"d43c2316-36bd-43be-8367-2116d9ffcb24","author":"ldsw","content":"Design decisions 2026-10-08: D1 steal wire format = tolerant decoder (skip unknown event types with warning) + hub minimum-reader-version marker gating LockStolen emission, 'hub require-version' checks live heartbeats (protocol change, needs upstream owners' agreement before step A merges). D2 git binary = CROSSLINK_GIT override, else on macOS one-time 'xcrun --find git' when PATH gives /usr/bin/git, fallback /usr/bin/git. Draft at .design/write-path-cost.md on branch design/write-path-cost; checked against vsdd-cli knowledge from 2026-10-08 (decisions section, evidence tagging, property ACs, failing-first ACs added). Precedent sweep of prior designs and code history in progress.","created_at":"2026-10-09T02:24:27.847656Z","kind":"decision","signed_by":"SHA256:2DlhR+oFnVKNEPsahz+cG6GYEUUTKJkJUtdRSniweHI","signature":"U1NIU0lHAAAAAQAAADMAAAALc3NoLWVkMjU1MTkAAAAgDPj6fD8/zRZvUXWw//OEuKiIM7V2BnG7lBF86x/hrWIAAAARY3Jvc3NsaW5rLWNvbW1lbnQAAAAAAAAABnNoYTUxMgAAAFMAAAALc3NoLWVkMjU1MTkAAABAKx73aYvptKjdfiSnnB1/2AE7jgOjTeoDlgsLuaJIRg1IIORjFu3lX/QZzPMRt7VgEysWaqZ9YTqibaC3AqsJDQ=="},"signed_by":"SHA256:2DlhR+oFnVKNEPsahz+cG6GYEUUTKJkJUtdRSniweHI","signature":"U1NIU0lHAAAAAQAAADMAAAALc3NoLWVkMjU1MTkAAAAgDPj6fD8/zRZvUXWw//OEuKiIM7V2BnG7lBF86x/hrWIAAAAPY3Jvc3NsaW5rLWV2ZW50AAAAAAAAAAZzaGE1MTIAAABTAAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5AAAAQNFv6ACgqBLeQ+a8WTcoXmxVwf4VKA5J2VY/XNss5C5d7o2Qle8olqGMFpp2q2oflVokUVY4eEf/JRh5ofKIZAc="}
{"agent_id":"ldsw","agent_seq":101,"timestamp":"2026-10-09T02:37:46.507367Z","event":{"type":"CommentAdded","issue_uuid":"eb1a4388-3986-477b-b657-86a21e83c800","comment_uuid":"079ba8c8-f422-4c19-bf06-4a63f457fcf2","author":"ldsw","content":"Reshaped 2026-10-08 per the vsdd-cli big-picture decisions (umbrella plus one document per increment, written at build time; work-in-progress limit): .design/write-path-cost.md is now the umbrella (increments by feature, in build order: lock-claim outcome and kickoff rollback; knowledge cache ownership; write cost; heartbeats off the write path; lock clearing on v3 hubs); .design/lock-claim-outcome-and-kickoff-rollback.md is the first increment's document. Precedent sweep changes: (1) an unconfirmed claim is NOT ownership (hub-v3 REQ-6(b): no state where two agents both verify ownership); session work exits with a rerun message and the rerun confirms without re-publishing; (2) the steal-format gate must reuse the generation descriptor protocol_version (exact-equality, fail-closed in every readiness-era binary) rather than a new meta-ref field; a decoder that skips an event must never publish a checkpoint covering it; (3) steal must re-check the holder's heartbeat just before emitting (hub-v3 'live-holder lock force-steal' defect); heartbeats still require ready (#794); per-command readiness caching must re-check record age and daemon liveness. Hook design (#814) waits under the WIP limit.","created_at":"2026-10-09T02:37:46.471881Z","kind":"decision","signed_by":"SHA256:2DlhR+oFnVKNEPsahz+cG6GYEUUTKJkJUtdRSniweHI","signature":"U1NIU0lHAAAAAQAAADMAAAALc3NoLWVkMjU1MTkAAAAgDPj6fD8/zRZvUXWw//OEuKiIM7V2BnG7lBF86x/hrWIAAAARY3Jvc3NsaW5rLWNvbW1lbnQAAAAAAAAABnNoYTUxMgAAAFMAAAALc3NoLWVkMjU1MTkAAABAy1j27ISoJPHBN/6y5rvQXgbLeDZl5mTypIVjWZnAe7fxpFi1lBcZ/iQqxoa0qOWzahDnGDVja9R92DjJmTfnBg=="},"signed_by":"SHA256:2DlhR+oFnVKNEPsahz+cG6GYEUUTKJkJUtdRSniweHI","signature":"U1NIU0lHAAAAAQAAADMAAAALc3NoLWVkMjU1MTkAAAAgDPj6fD8/zRZvUXWw//OEuKiIM7V2BnG7lB